# Copy this file to rmodeler.conf, in the same directory as worker.sh /
# workers.sh, and uncomment + edit whatever you want to set permanently.
#
# Anything left commented out keeps its built-in default. Anything already
# exported in your shell environment (e.g. `THREADS=12 ./worker.sh`) wins
# over whatever is set here. To use a config file at a different path
# instead, set CONFIG_FILE=/path/to/file before running either script.
#
# Format: plain KEY=value, one per line. Quotes around the value are
# optional. This file is read, not sourced -- it cannot run shell commands.

# IN_DIR=/data/genomes
# WORK_DIR=/scratch/rmodeler/work
# OUT_DIR=/data/rmodeler/out
# STATE_DIR=/data/rmodeler/state
# LOG_DIR=/data/rmodeler/logs

# RM_IMAGE=dfam/tetools:latest
# DOCKER=docker
# THREADS=6
# MEM_LIMIT=
# ENGINE=ncbi
# GLOB=*.fna.gz
# LTRSTRUCT=0
# KEEP_WORK=0
# RETRY_FAILED=0
# STOP_GRACE=10

# workers.sh only:
# RUN_DIR=/data/rmodeler/state/run
